      "writtenOn": "2022-01-24T14:46:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, the driver itself is much more extended than the one in CrosEC. Unfortunately, I think it will be hard to reduce. Adding CONFIG_EEPROM_AT2X_NO_WP saves 144bytes(increase 844-\u003e700), but apart from that, I don\u0027t have any ideas(removing the size function, which is not used, saves only 16bytes). I\u0027m preparing the patch with CONFIG_EEPROM_AT2X_NO_WP.",
