      "writtenOn": "2022-01-21T23:12:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do have any ideas on how to get this info from the devicetree?  We can easily get rid of CONFIG_WP_ACTIVE_HIGH since this can be set in the device-tree with GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH/LOW.\n\nBut where do we specify the GPIO?  Maybe we try to extend the upstream driver to indicate the wp-gpios property is read only?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 22,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 26,
        "endChar": 6
      },
      "revId": "b8c6499d2eace278ec19a5083d4b3e74ba3b34b5",
