      "writtenOn": "2022-01-24T14:46:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The WP active low/high is a pure EC thing and it is for the whole system. The AT2x chips always interpret the WP pin as active-low, so IMO it wouldn\u0027t make sense to change the driver.\n\nThe GPIO is specified in the named-gpio node, and we use the enum GPIO_WP/WP_L. I will try to find a better solution for that.",
      "parentUuid": "c638bac5_718e1456",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 22,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 26,
        "endChar": 6
      },
