      "message": "Even if we want to keep GPIO_WP for now. Now that Andrew\u0027s change https://crrev.com/c/3392111 has merged, you should change this to use gpio_pin_get_dt(GPIO_DT_FROM_NODELABEL(cros_gpio_wp)).\n\nYou\u0027ll need to add GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW flag to the corresponding GPIO node in the device tree.\n\nYou can create an chosen node to pick the correct GPIO.",
